  "title": "Global-e to Announce Financial Results for the First Quarter 2026 on May 13, 2026",
  "summary": "PETAH-TIKVA, Israel, April 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Global-e Online Ltd. (Nasdaq: GLBE), the platform powering global direct-to-consumer e-commerce, today announced it will report financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, before market open on Wednesday, May 13, 2026.",
